note SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0
note Pure seeded OM-2 port of src/aarch64_decoder.c (AArch64 instruction decoder
note and code-buffer validator). Composes on om/aarch64/aarch64_om2.om.
om2

fn aarch64_decode_instruction insn ulong dst edit ulong 9 to long
  ret a64decode insn dst
end

fn aarch64_validate_code_buffer code view uchar * n ulong msg edit uchar * ml ulong to long
  ret a64validate code n msg ml
end
